<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 23.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 23.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alexis 20,000 tonnes hss USG/Vera Cruz early Nov $10.00 fio five days/2,000 Glencore (adds vessel name, charterer).</p>
<p>Flag Mersinidi 90,000 long tons barely Hamburg-Rotterdam range/Jeddah prompt $16.00 fio 7,000/3,000 Soufflet (adds vessel name, charter).</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
